  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEg">III Eg</ref> 7.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þonne ne mæge, gewilde man hine swa hwaðer swa man mæge, swa cucune swa deadne, ⁊ niman eal þæt he age, ⁊ gilde man ðam teondan his ceapgild angildes, ⁊ fo se hlaford elles to healfum, to healfum þæt hundred.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he cannot do do, they shall seize him as they can, either alive or dead, and they shall take all that he has, and pay the accuser the unaugmented value of his goods; and the lord of the manor shall take half [of what remains], and the hundred half.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he þonne ne mæge, gewylde man hine swaðor man mæge, swa cwicne swa deadne; ⁊ nime man eal þæt he age ⁊ gylde man þam teonde his ceapgyld ángeldes, ⁊ fo se landhlaford to healfan, to healfan þæt hundred.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
